<h1>router.conf</h1>
<p class="muted">
  This is the file on disk at <code><%= @path %></code>, read as-is. The router does not exist yet;
  when it does it will read this and nothing else. It is rewritten whole on every change to any sheet,
  pool, or service row — never patched.
</p>

<% if @body.nil? %>
  <div class="warn">not written yet. Save a sheet, or press render.</div>
<% else %>
  <pre><%= @body %></pre>
<% end %>

<form action="<%= router_config_path %>/render" method="post">
  <input type="hidden" name="authenticity_token" value="<%= form_authenticity_token %>">
  <button type="submit">re-render from state/ now</button>
</form>

<h2>How to check it, rather than trust it</h2>
<pre># totality: delete a line, change nothing, save any sheet — the line comes back
sed -i '/^allow/d' state/router.conf && touch state/agents/*.yml   # then re-render
# purity: identical intent renders identical bytes
sha256sum state/router.conf; curl -s -X POST .../router.conf/render; sha256sum state/router.conf</pre>
